ecture services in Gurgaon by 9th Corner: site planning, elevations, 3D views and working drawings for homes, offices and buildings.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/gurgaon/services-architecture-services\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Gurgaon\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"\n\n    <!-- FAQ Schema -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What types of projects are covered under architecture services in Gurgaon?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Architecture services can cover residential properties, villas, offices, commercial buildings, retail spaces, showrooms, and landscape areas. Each project is planned according to its purpose and requirements.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is included in professional architectural design?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Professional architectural design can include site planning, space planning, circulation, natural light, ventilation, structural considerations, material planning, and 3D visualization according to the project.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do you provide residential and commercial architecture solutions?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, our architecture services plan residential and commercial projects according to their specific requirements. Residential designs can focus on comfort and privacy, while commercial designs can consider business activities, accessibility, and visitor movement.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How does 3D visualization help in architectural projects?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"3D visualization provides a clearer view of the proposed building, layouts, shapes, materials, and overall appearance before construction. It also helps clients review the design and suggest changes during the planning stage.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Are sustainable solutions included in architectural planning?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, sustainable architectural planning can include approaches that improve natural light, ventilation, energy efficiency, material selection, and the practical use of natural resources while\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Are there more interior design services available?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, along with architecture services in Gurgaon, Ninth Corner offers a range of other interior design services for residential and commercial spaces. You can explore our Interior Design Services page to learn more about the available services and find the right option for your project.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n <style>\n/* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Why Choose Us (Checklist) --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1100px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list li strong {\n            display: block;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 12px 36px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n\n\n                /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Architecture Services in Gurgaon</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Professional Architecture Services for Well-Planned and Functional Spaces</h2>\n            <p>Good architecture brings together design, comfort, function, and long-term value. <b>Architecture Services in Gurgaon/Gurugram</b> help you plan and build spaces that serve their intended purpose while creating attractive and durable structures. From independent homes to commercial spaces, professional architecture planning ensures that each design considers the site, surrounding environment, space efficiency, and future requirements.</p>\n            <p>Each scheme has a purpose, site, feel, and volume requirements. The design process starts with an understanding of these requirements. A home may require privacy and natural lighting, while a commercial space requires easy access, clear layouts, and professional appeal.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Professional Architectural Design for Comfortable and Functional Buildings</h2>\n            <p>For us, architecture is not only building planning. That is making buildings where people feel comfortable, functional and suitable for the everyday routine. We know your needs, objectives, site and preferences prior to designing.</p>\n            <p>For clients seeking <b>professional architecture services in Gurgaon</b>, we focus on a balanced approach that brings creativity and practical planning together. We take each element and apply it to the entire project. Every consideration, from planning the entrances to the relationship of the spaces to one another, contributes to a design that assists daily activities.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Residential & Commercial Architectural Design</h3>\n                <p>Our architecture services cover home villas, office and commercial buildings. Home designs are conceptualised around the concepts of comfort, privacy, natural light, and daily activities.</p>\n                <p>The commercial and office plans highlight practicality and accessibility, the comfort of occupants and employees, and effective branding through the space design. Our residential architecture solutions in Gurgaon are developed according to the needs of the family.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Retail Spaces & Landscape Architecture</h3>\n                <p>Retail and showroom spaces need designs that make products easy to see and create a comfortable experience for visitors. Planning display spaces, circulation, access, and other essential elements takes into account the function of the area.</p>\n                <p>Value is added to the open outdoor space-a garden, a terrace, an entryway-through landscape architecture. Plants, circulation paths, sitting elements, and other components are integrated for a harmonious experience.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Integrated Planning & 3D Visualization</h3>\n                <p>Good architecture services and interior planning should work together. We consider structural requirements and interior needs so that the final space feels connected and balanced.</p>\n                <p>3D modeling and visualization can help clients understand the proposed design before construction begins. It gives a clearer view of layouts, shapes, materials, and overall appearance, assisting communications & modifications prior to execution.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Sustainable & Future-Ready Architecture</h3>\n                <p>Modern architecture should consider both present needs and future use. We use planning ideas that can improve natural light, ventilation, energy use, and overall comfort wherever suitable.</p>\n                <p>Sustainable choices may include energy-efficient solutions, suitable materials, and designs that make better use of natural resources. Our sustainable architecture services in Gurgaon aim to create spaces that are responsible as well as useful.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Our Architecture Services in Gurgaon?</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Choosing the right architectural team can make the design and execution process easier. Architecture Services in Gurgaon/Gurugram should be based on clear planning, practical ideas, and attention to project requirements.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Experienced Architects</strong>\n                    Proven track record in designing residential villas, corporate buildings, and retail commercial spaces.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Solutions</strong>\n                    Site-responsive planning optimizing natural light, ventilation, zoning, and long-term functional value.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Sustainable & Innovative Design</strong>\n                    Energy-efficient layouts, bioclimatic strategies, and responsible use of durable building materials.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>End-to-End Project Management</strong>\n                    Full-spectrum management from conceptual blueprints and 3D visualization to structural supervision.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Gurgaon</h2>\n                <p>Showcasing our completed residential and commercial spaces designed with excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                                        <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div cl